[] arm:requirement "/req/query-rewrite-extension/sf-query-rewrite" ;
   arm:conformanceClass "query-rewrite-extension" ;
   arm:bucket "query-rewrite" ;
   arm:disposition "decided" ;
   arm:evidence "The semantic rewrite entry expands the eight sf* relation properties per the specification's four transformation-rule cases, dark by default and composed explicitly: Geo/GeoQueryRewriteSparqlTests binds the feature-feature, feature-geometry, geometry-feature, and geometry-geometry cases through parsed queries (FeatureFeatureCaseDerivesThroughTheRewrite and the case rows), keeps the asserted route (TheAssertedRouteSurvivesTheRewrite), answers each pair once under the entailment regime's set semantics (EveryDerivablePairAnswersExactlyOnce), pins the stated bounds (variable predicates and property paths stay asserted-only) and both degradations (dark and functionless), and the feature-level roster (EveryTopologicalPropertyAnswersItsPinnedVerdictThroughTheRewrite) carries the sf rows; the Database-project Database/GeoRewriteThreadingTests rows prove the pipeline reaches both engine lanes through the engine options." .

