[] arm:requirement "/req/query-rewrite-extension/rcc8-query-rewrite" ;
   arm:conformanceClass "query-rewrite-extension" ;
   arm:bucket "query-rewrite" ;
   arm:disposition "decided" ;
   arm:evidence "Two routes: the same semantic rewrite entry covers the eight rcc8* relation properties (Geo/GeoQueryRewriteSparqlTests.EveryTopologicalPropertyRoutesToItsFunction and the rcc8 rows of the feature-level roster), and the entailment-side composition capability derives new rcc8 relations from asserted ones with no geometry - exact converses plus singleton-composition-cell materialization to the fixpoint, silent on disjunctive cells since a disjunctive cell is not assertable as a triple. The table's laws and its geometric certification against the computed predicates are the Tests-project Geo/Rcc8CompositionTests rows (identity, converse symmetry, the pinned twenty-seven-singleton roster, the sixty-four-cell witness sweep), and Database/GeoRewriteThreadingTests.TheCompositionClosureFeedsTheAssertedRouteEndToEnd lands derived relations as plain triples that match with no pipeline and no geometry." .
